{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_036C20","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"你是什么时候加入<R=FSLN,SANDINISTA>的？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=FSLN,SANDINISTA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":49,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"大约一年前。我和<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>他们一起进了山。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":67,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"你父亲原本不就是<R=FSLN,SANDINISTA>的吗？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=FSLN,SANDINISTA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":52,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"不是。<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>确实和Sandino将军一起战斗过，但后来一度退隐了。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":95,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"他找了工作，成了家，我们也出生了。不过有一天，<R=FSLN,SANDINISTA>的学生们找上门来……。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=FSLN,SANDINISTA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":121,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"旧日的热血又沸腾起来了？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"差不多吧。不过说到底，他只是帮那些被<R=国民警卫队,LA GUARDIA>追捕的人逃走而已。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=国民警卫队,LA GUARDIA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"可是<R=警卫队,LA GUARDIA>的人追来了。他们突然闯进家里，盛气凌人地盘问<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=警卫队,LA GUARDIA>\", \"<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":118,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"父亲当然什么都没说。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"不过他被狠狠打了一顿，家里也被砸得一团糟。之后他们盯上了他，动不动就来骚扰。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":114,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"从那以后，<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>才开始投身<R= FSLN ,SANDINISTA>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>\", \"<R= FSLN ,SANDINISTA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":73,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED; SOURCE_RUBY_SPACING_PRESERVED"},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"即便如此，他还是一直瞒着我们，不想让危险波及我们。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"是个好父亲啊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"是啊……但妈妈先撑不住了，离开了家。也不能怪她。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"你没跟你母亲走吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"当然犹豫过。可我很尊敬<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>，也无法容忍Somoza的做法。而且……。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":103,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"Chico？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":8,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"……那孩子特别黏<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>。说什么也要留下，我也不能把他丢下。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=父亲,MI VIEJO>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":97,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"后来我们被<R=国民警卫队,LA GUARDIA>追赶，躲进了山里……大概就是这样。有一半算是顺势而为。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=国民警卫队,LA GUARDIA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":126,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"不过你战斗起来倒是相当有模有样。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"山会把人磨炼成战士。训练越严酷，越能让人成为<R=新人,HOMBRE NUEVO>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=新人,HOMBRE NUEVO>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":92,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"果然是个了不起的姐姐。难怪会被推荐为<R=司令官,COMANDANTE>。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=司令官,COMANDANTE>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"}]}